+# SRE On-call, Legal & Compliance Playbook (summary)
+
+Sections:
+1) On-call & Escalation
+ - Primary on-call for inference: page SRE on PagerDuty. Provide runbook for speculative = disable circuit breaker, roll back canary if needed.
+ - Incident triage steps: identify whether safety (verifier failure), quality (regression), cost (budget exhausted) or infra.
+
+2) Legal & Compliance
+ - Evidence retention: verify S3 bucket has Object Lock enabled and retention config matches legal policy.
+ - Data retention & deletion: process to request and verify deletion of PII-labeled artifacts.
+ - Signoffs: maintain ledger of SME approvals (services/factuality/sme_signoff.py) and archive signoff artifacts.
+
+3) Billing & Rater Capacity
+ - Ensure budget manager hooks are wired to billing system and trigger tenant notifications via Billing API.
+ - Rater capacity planning: use capacity_planner module and autoscaler integration to maintain SLA.
+
+4) Playbooks and runbooks available:
+ - Production checklist (ops/runbooks/production_checklist.md)
+ - Promotion and rollback runbooks (ops/runbooks/Operator_Autonomy_Playbook.md)
